  era: "1813\u20131853 \xB7 Section 27 \xB7 Constitutional Development \xB7 1773 \u2013 1949"
  title: Charter Acts
  text: Charter Acts renewed the Company's charter. The Act of 1813 ended its trade monopoly except in tea and with China and set aside money for education; 1833 created the Governor-General of India and ended its trade; 1853 opened the civil services to competition.
